    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_2acbbdb7",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: i_see_you_nagger; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image features a photograph of actor and rapper Nelly, overlaid with the text 'i see you' at the top and 'nagger!' at the bottom. The term 'nagger' is a derogatory racial slur historically used against Black people, and its inclusion here constitutes a direct hateful attack based on race. The meme uses the juxtaposition of Nelly's neutral or slightly smug expression with the offensive text to create a confrontational and demeaning message. The overall intent is to target and insult an individual based on his race, fitting the definition of a hateful meme. The visual material (Nelly's image) is mapped onto the textual material ('nagger!') to deliver a racially charged insult, leveraging his public identity to amplify the harm. This meme is not merely humorous or satirical; it is explicitly hostile and promotes racial hatred.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_cfd9ca5c"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
