      "label": "Nelly as a public figure",
      "description": "Nelly is a well-known American rapper and actor. His public identity as a Black man in the entertainment industry makes him a recognizable figure. The meme uses his image to deliver a racially charged insult, leveraging his public status to amplify the impact of the hate message. This is a form of targeted harassment based on his race and fame.",
