      "description": "The overall intent of the meme is to deliver a racially hateful message. The juxtaposition of Nelly's neutral or smug expression with the offensive text 'nagger!' is designed to create a confrontational and demeaning message. This is not satire or humor; it is a direct attack based on race, fitting the definition of a hateful meme.",
